# Drift tracked root entries allowlist
# One root entry per line (exact name or glob). Comments and empty lines are ignored.
# Goal: keep the repository root limited to product entry points, governance,
# build/release control files, and a small set of top-level evidence directories.

# Claude Code plugin. Both locations are fixed by the plugin format and cannot
# be moved into a subdirectory: the manifest is read from `.claude-plugin/`,
# and slash commands are only discovered in `commands/` at the plugin root.
# The plugin root is the repository root because the marketplace entry points
# at "./", which is what makes `/plugin marketplace add mick-gsk/drift` work.
